{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WISHLIST AND FOLLOW US !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Slash the Falling Words!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/Slash.gif?t=1749116109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type words to slash them before they hit the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Falling Words Come In Unique Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/Slash_Types.gif?t=1749116109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 10 different mechanics that change how the words fall and behave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use Power-Ups!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/powerups.gif?t=1749116109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn power-ups every phase and use them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/Bosses.gif?t=1749116109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ boss battles across different game modes and difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/RogueExample.gif?t=1749116109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is different. Collect gold, upgrade damage, get abilities and passives.</p><p clas